{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_035hin_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_035hin_2000_situation", "source_sha256": "696eb03879931840b9b01f62bbf214ac88f9becd509d878ede2483039e46d573", "ja": "モデルのお仕事　本番前", "zh": "模特儿工作　正式拍摄前", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_035hin_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_035hin_2000_place", "source_sha256": "dc2eab181b21579d24af8758a5c8880d3a25c4048161584a8837b0a8c92754ca", "ja": "控え室", "zh": "准备室", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_035hin_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_035hin_2001_035hin", "source_sha256": "889289656f9e47a01a3f512ba4e19e9abaed95b3ba867f7f89a30f76939115bf", "ja": "あのね、今日の衣装だけんど、あったらおしゃれな服、\nあたしには似合わないんでないかなあ？", "zh": "那个，关于今天的服装，那么时髦的衣服\n应该不适合我吧～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_035hin_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_035hin_2002_p", "source_sha256": "8aa434508d5ca970f5f33acc9a4cdfda6b10166b106f4c13e7263beb6baf4979", "ja": "そんなことないよ。色もデザインも、\nひなたのイメージにぴったりだ。きっと似合うから。", "zh": "没这回事喔，颜色和设计都\n和日向的形象一拍即合，一定很适合的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_035hin_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_035hin_2003_035hin", "source_sha256": "275be81f5e1903da8029f651f7c5f7266f80bd0ddc4a66b184599c7f204cd947", "ja": "でも、手の込んだレースなんかもいっぱいで……。\nあたしなんかが着て、笑われたりしないだろか？", "zh": "但还有一大堆细致的蕾丝……\n我这种人穿会不会被笑呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_035hin_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_035hin_2004_p", "source_sha256": "2bf588ae1a3c9307c00fce44b494fafc45fc0e554fdb9ac38eeb88b1a51e4bf8", "ja": "むしろ、ひなたが着るからいいんだよ。\nまずは俺を信じて、着てみてくれないか。", "zh": "就是要日向穿才好啊，\n可以先相信我，穿上去看看吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_035hin_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_035hin_2005_035hin", "source_sha256": "5891eb21c94a4493db77df6f43878f5d65abed6a3674a040e1a4033ea2020775", "ja": "{$P$}がそう言うんなら……。\nわかったべさ。あたし、がんばってみるねえ。", "zh": "{$P$}都这么说了……\n我知道了，我会努力看看～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
